notes:        Lumetri Color panel: Basic Correction with temperature, tint, saturation, exposure, contrast and tone sliders, and the Creative, Curves, Color Wheels & Match, HSL Secondary and Vignette sections each with their own on/off switch. 341x808 crop. Contains no third-party, Adobe or copyrighted footage. All UI icons are drawn in code; fonts are Inter and JetBrains Mono (OFL-1.1).
